  <h1>DeepSeek vs. TotalRecalls</h1>
  <p>DeepSeek does not provide a one-click data export for chat history. TotalRecalls reads your active browser session and converts it to portable Markdown and JSON.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Official export:</strong> Not available.</li>
    <li><strong>TotalRecalls:</strong> Markdown + JSON with full transcripts and DeepSeek's chain-of-thought blocks preserved.</li>
  </ul>
